<title>UK: UK extends notice for Ashbourne acquisition.</title>
<headline>UK extends notice for Ashbourne acquisition.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain's Director General of Fair Trading said on Friday he was extending the deadline for consideration of the proposed acquisition of Ashbourne Plc by Sun Healthcare Group Inc by 15 days to January 31, 1997.</p>
<p>Sun Healthcare has made a bid for Ashbourne through one of its group firms Exceler and has agreed on a price of 177 pence per share, valuing the issued capital of Ashbourne at about 95 million stg.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
